window.products.push({"id":573022,"name":"Croscill Monroe Pole Top Drapery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10IJt+5c4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Monroe bedding collection features an incredibly rich and dramatic engineered design on both comforter and shams. The top of the bed shows an intricate layout of scroll-like frames with a damask medallion in the center. The designs are gold on diamond texture ground in a vibrant Blue color. Shams feature a scroll border frame on the same diamond texture. This pattern is achieved through a special loom that allows us to weave an engineered jacquard design, also creating dimension in texture in the weaves. Both feature a printed reverse and are trimmed with a multi-color twist cord. The bed skirt in faux silk is pleated with multiple pleats and embellished with an intricately woven gimp. The European sham showcases a pleated brocade fabric on the top in Blue and gold embellished with an intricate tassel Fringe and pieced with faux silk. It reverses to a woven stripe which gives a modern touch to the sham and it is trimmed in a delicate cord. The basic square pillow features an engineered medallion on its face and reverses to a faux silk. The pillow is embellished with an intricate cord. The fashion square pillow in faux silk features intricate embroidery in shades of Blue and gold. This pillow reverses to faux silk and is trimmed with a delicate cord. The boudoir pillow has a pieced construction of the floral brocade, faux silk and woven stripe. The pillow reverses to the faux silk and is embellished with a tassel Fringe and gimp. The Monroe window panels in the diamond texture are accented by a scroll border. A federal valance in the diamond texture completes the look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10IJt+5c4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B0178FOW80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0178FOW80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0178FOW80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
