window.products.push({"id":573126,"name":"Balsam Hill Berkshire Channel Stitch Tree Skirt, 72 inches, Ivory White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SWrbxHCfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLUSH FABRIC: Balsam Hill’s Berkshire Quilted Tree Skirt is made of plush fabric to give it an extremely soft and soothing touch. The skirt is high quality, thick and very comfortable. It is designed to give your room a cozy, Christmas feel. The material is 100% polyester. ELEGANT QUILTED STITCH: It features a beautiful channel stitch quilting pattern on top of the plush fabric. The design is concentric circular to add a simple yet sophisticated adornment to your tree. 72’’ SIZE: For the best effect, we recommend that the diameter of the tree skirt be at least 6” more than the full width of the tree. The complete diameter of this tree skit is 72 inches. RICH IVORY COLOR: The rich ivory color of the tree skirt will add a beautiful accent to your Christmas tree. It drapes perfectly around the tree giving it a rich-looking, natural look. DRY CLEAN ONLY: Do not machine wash the skirt. Dry clean only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SWrbxHCfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Balsam Hill","source_asin":"B0153AY09S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0153AY09S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0153AY09S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573127,"name":"DALSTRONG Sauce Pot - 3 Quart - The Avalon Series - 5-Ply Copper Core Cookware - Cooking Pot - Hammered Finish Stock Pot - Premium Silver Pots and Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGLs7OHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dalstrong Avalon Series 3 quart pot is the perfect mid-size pot for cooking up family portions of soups and curries, or blanching vegetables. Beautiful hammer-finished 18/10 stainless steel exterior. A 3 quart size is just large enough to heat up four to six servings of soup. It'll hold a couple bottles of wine for reducing, and is a good size for boiling and poaching eggs. Make a nice risotto, cook up a side of rice, or boil up some corn or peas to go with Sunday dinner. 5-PLY COPPER CORE COOKWARE — the ultimate in heat conductivity, control, and responsiveness. Thanks to a copper core, Avalon pots and pans respond to temperature changes 5X faster than iron and 20X faster than stainless steel. Layers of smudge-free aluminum & 18/10 stainless steel above and below the Copper Forged Foundation provide maximum durability and easy maintenance without compromising the conductivity. The copper core means this cookware heats and cools quickly when you adjust the heat. TRUE HEAVY GAUGE COOKWARE WITH VENTED LID — Ultra strong 2.5mm thickness that will never dent or warp under prolonged heat, for consistent cooking results every time. Heavy gauge cookware is strong, durable, and impervious to scratches. The bottom stays perfectly flat for even heat distribution. Strong, stainless steel lids will last a lifetime and maintain a perfect seal. The vented hole releases pressure to prevent rattling and food from boiling over. ERGONOMIC HANDLES AND FLARED LIP— All of the handles in Avalon pots, pans, and skillets are ergonomic. Designed to accommodate a professional chef's underhand grip, the perfectly angled handles ensure a comfortable and secure hold while cooking. Never drop or spill a dish again, thanks to handles that are easy to grip even while wearing oven mitts. Engraved side handles add even more control, while a flared lip creates the perfect drip-free pour, for easier dishing up and serving of sauces. LIFETIME WARRANTY against defects. Rocksolid 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk free, with renowned Dalstrong customer service. Over one million orders have been fulfilled so far. Compatible with all stovetops, oven and broiler safe up to 800 degrees F, freezer, dishwasher, and refrigerator safe. Avalon cookware is made from non-toxic, hypoallergenic materials that are PFOA and PTFE free, and the stainless steel surface is ultra-durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGLs7OHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B09SJY92YQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SJY92YQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SJY92YQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
