window.products.push({"id":573177,"name":"Veniibot N1 Max Sweeping and Mopping Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, Lidar Navigation, 2000Pa Strong Suction，Self-Charging and Self-Cleaning Robotic Vacuum Cl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pcd6rDi+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Three Modes：The N1 Max has three cleaning modes: Only sweeping, only mopping, sweeping and mopping together. You can set it up according to your needs, which saves you both trouble and worry. Owning a N1 Max is equivalent to owning a sweeping robot and a mopping robot at the same time. Lidar Navigation：The N1 Max has lidar navigation, using a lidar launcher at the top that scans the surrounding terrain, generates maps, plans cleaning routes, and efficiently cleans to avoid going around in circles. You can log in to the app of your mobile phone to see the map formed after scanning by N1 Max. 2000Pa Suction：With a strong suction of 2000 Pa, The N1 Max can easily absorb the garbage on the way forward, such as pet hair, pet food, paper scrap, food residue, etc. It can also clean the garbage next to the robot with the side brush, which is very convenient. Pressurized Mopping：Under the mopping mode, the N1 Max lowers the mop through the crank connecting rod and the spring-loaded struts, and applies a force of about 10N to the ground, which can Hold the mop more close to the ground to mopping. Compared with the ordinary sweeping robot, which only \"lightly touches the ground\", N1 Max Can clean the floor more cleanly. Self-charging and self-cleaning system：The N1 Max will automatically return to the base for charging when the battery is lower than 15%, and it will leave the base when the battery is charged to 80%, Then it will continue to work. Under the mopping mode, N1 Max will return to the base to clean the mop after a certain period of time. The 800ml clean water tank and 800ml sewage tank on both sides of the base can clean the mop and collect sewage to avoid secondary pollution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pcd6rDi+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veniibot","source_asin":"B08VN81TQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VN81TQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VN81TQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
