window.products.push({"id":573233,"name":"Small Hat Storage Box | Travel Hat Bag | Round Pop-up Storage Container for Fedoras and Small Hats | 13.5 Inch Wide | Collapsible Stackable | Hat Orga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91odj61qaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW DO OUR HAT BOXES COMPARE TO OTHERS? It's simple. Let's break it down: ✨ ADDED STABILITY FOR STACKING: Our round storage containers are still easily collapsible and pop-up to open,  however, we've added metal rod stabilizers to help them maintain their shape while in use. This makes them easier to stack and more importantly, keeps your cherished belongings from getting crushed. ✨ OPTIMIZED AS A HAT BOX FOR TRAVEL Lightweight and easy to use, but we've added features for use during travel!  Not only did we add elastic straps for keeping your belongings secure, we've also added two handles for carrying and the wide handle acts as a luggage sleeve to slide onto your carry-on bag. ✨ DECORATIVE STYLE & DESIGN: Three colors to choose from to match your interior space, as well as high quality materials. The fabric is waterproof and the faux leather elements add to the trendy modern look and will fit any pretty closet.\" ✨ MULTIPLE WAYS TO USE: These organizing containers are often used to store:  - Hats for women or men (fedoras, small and narrow-brim hats, etc) up to 13.5\" wide. - Baseball caps - Wigs and Wig Accessories - Many, many more! ✨ THOUGHTFUL SIZING: The dimensions are roomy to store multiple items, but modest enough to fit into smaller closets and for use during travel. The opened size is 14\" diameter and 6.5\" deep. Compressed, it can be as small as 1.5\" for safe and easy storage. Please see our other listing for larger hat storage boxes! ✨ HAPPIBOX GUARANTEE: We are not happy unless you are! Contact us with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91odj61qaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HappiBox","source_asin":"B0928HCNFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928HCNFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928HCNFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
