window.products.push({"id":573343,"name":"Galic April You and Me 6-Inch Set, Pepper and Salt Mill with Soft Touch Tops, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VMlvJFSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Galic Mills are recognized for their outstanding quality, European design and superb value. These mills are versatile and feature a multi-purpose hard ceramic grinding mechanism designed to grind: pepper, salt, dried herbs and spices. The Galic assortment offers a wide range of materials, colors and finishes for you to choose from. The tops of these traditionally-shaped Galic mills (with the exception of the 11-inch pepper mill) are uniformly sized which allows you to mix, match and change the look of your mill. To use your Galic mill, unscrew the top nut, remove the mill head, and fill the reservoir with dry peppers, salts and spices. Grind contents by holding the mill body steady and turning the head in a clockwise direction. Tighten or loosen the top nut to adjust your grind from powdery fine to extra course. This April You and Me Set includes one six-inch pepper mill and one six-inch salt mill. Both mills are made of crystal clear acrylic with soft touch blue tops. The ceramic grinding mechanisms come with a 10 year warranty against manufacturing/materials defect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VMlvJFSQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Galic","source_asin":"B003VWDE2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VWDE2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VWDE2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573344,"name":"Craig Frames 23247 Picture Frame, 8 x 10, Brazilian Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813kseySqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This brand new picture frame is manufactured in the USA at our facility in Ithaca, Michigan using the best materials and tools available. Please review the product listing details of the frame selection you have made. Our picture frames SMALLER than 12x18 Inch (inside dimensions) are carefully and completely assembled with GLASS facing and a durable backing with two machine-cut, low profile wall hangers for both horizontal and vertical hanging. Our picture frames will compliment any space that you hang them in, they make great gifts and they will protect and display your photographs and artwork for years to come. If you have any questions or comments, please do not hesitate to contact us. Feel free to visit our storefront and seller info pages to browse our extensive selection of frames, read customer feedback or review our policies and contact info. At the end of the day we want you to be completely happy with your purchase. Be sure to add us to your list of favorites so you can easily find us the next time you need a quality picture frame. Thank you for shopping with us. We are Craig Frames and we are framing the world.one customer at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813kseySqTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craig Frames","source_asin":"B09W5CTNS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5CTNS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5CTNS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573345,"name":"Wicker Decorative and Serving Tray with Handle, Round Rattan Woven Tray for Fruit Serving, Coffee Table Tray, Vanity Tray Organiser for Kitchen Home S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q3DM3HioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KINDLY NOTE: In case you have any concerns with the purchased item or the product has any defects, PLEASE do not hesitate to request replacement items, a perfect alternation will be promptly sent to you with no additional fee. No return is required for the original ones. Our customer service is always ready to co-operate. Your satisfaction is our top priority! VERSATILE USE - Our round serving tray with handles serves various purposes. It can be used as a breakfast tray for an energized breakfast in bed; a tea tray for a fun afternoon tea break; bar trays for liquor display; countertop display tray or as wicker baskets for hampers storage; small coffee table centerpiece. You can even choose to hang it on your wall, to add a unique rustic charm to your home decor. PREMIUM QUALITY - Our wicker tray is woven by artisans in Vietnam, from carefully-chosen natural seagrass, a very strong and sturdy materials. The tray is made to last a long time in use without losing its beautiful shape and color. It is free of splinter and strange odor. Please take note to keep the tray in dry and airy condition. PROTECTING MOTHER EARTH - This woven round shallow basket is made from rattan, a plant that is largely grown in Vietnam. It is environmentally friendly from every angle. Rattan does not leave an excess of negative impacts due to harvesting and transportation. When compared with plastics, wicker baskets made of natural rattan are far more ecologically sound. YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT - MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This wicker tray basket, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Vietnamese local Villages. With every purchase you make, you are helping us make a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q3DM3HioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08Q86PGCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q86PGCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q86PGCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573346,"name":"Supodon Quilt Set Oversized King Bedspread 128x120 Lightweight Coverlet 3 Piece Comforter Set Super King Plus (128\"x120\", White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPXau-iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER BIG - It can wrap the entire bed well, allowing you to roll over the bed as you like. Easily cover all sides and end of your bed, even with extra layers of padding!Can easily solve the trouble of not covering enough quilt. Suitable for family use! LIGHTWEIGHT AND BREATHABLE - Big but lightweight. Super soft microfiber is stitched in a multilayered construction that creates lightweight.Soft and silent, no leaking, breathable, providing a super cosy and sweet night sleep. Suitable for all age groups and skin types, do not cause skin problem. FINE WORKMANSHIP & LUXURIOUS - The quilt has pretty and intricate quilting, features a sophisticated design of circle stitched quilt pattern, add classic style to your bedroom with a solid quilt set. Different from those ultrasonic printing quilts, we adopts high-cost thread sewing. The neat stitches increase the durability of the quilt comforter set, stabilize the filling, which is better at keeping you warm. YEAR-ROUND ESSENTIAL - Perfect for Spring/Summer on their own and with sheets, or during colder periods and on cooler nights use them as a bedspread over your duvet cover for extra insulation. Order 1 set and use as quilt, bedspread, comforter set, blanket,bed cover, perfect for year-round use. DURABLE & EASY CARE - Machine washable gentle cycle in cold water. Low temperature drying, sun-dry or tumble dry on low heat setting. Do not bleach or iron. Certified OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 and BSCI. High-quality materials, no tearing after washing, but soften, for long lasting comfort. (Due to the use of vacuum package, the quilt will arrive shriveled and wrinkled, please wash and dry it to puff it and remove the wrinkles.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPXau-iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supodon","source_asin":"B09HGVN4YJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HGVN4YJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HGVN4YJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
