window.products.push({"id":573421,"name":"Sonive All Season Comforter Soft Fluffy Breathable Microfiber 200gsm Down Alternative Bedding Duvet Insert with 8 Corner Tabs Easy Care (Black, Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSRKRNQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SNUGGLY COMFY: Made of curled soft flexible fiber, this comforter is fluffy and soft as goose feather that you want to hold tight every night. The whole-piece fill-in comforter provides an added puffy touching. It will be even softer after washing, providing brilliant cozy feeling, like sleeping under a cloud. Best for those who love fluffy. ALL-SEASON COMFORTER: This is an ideal comforter for all seasons. The premium-quality fabric is double brushed on both sides which is super soft. The filling of this comforter is made of hollow polyester fiber, making the comforter breathable and moisture-wicking. With a proper thickness, our comforter perfectly combines right weight and breathability. It can maintain an even temperature throughout the night, providing the right warmth & coziness in both warmer and cooler months. ELEGANT DESIGN & WELL-FITTED: Classic black color and box stitching, this comforter provides an elegant decor for your room. Box-stitch design keeps the down-alternative fill from shifting. 8 corner tabs are more stable than traditional design, easily matching your duvet cover. Also, it can be just used alone. A great-value gift choice for your family and friends and for all kinds of rooms. SIZE & EASY CARE: Twin/Twin xl: 64x88\", Full: 82x86\", Queen Size: 88x88\", King Size: 104x88\". Machine washing cold, gentle cycle; Tumble or naturally dry, gentle cycle. No bleach, no iron. You also can put it inside a duvet cover and washing the cover as needed. Regular shaking and sunshine can keep your comforter fluffy for years as it was the day you brought it home. CUSTOMER SERVICES: We create a cozier home for you with our 50 years' experience in textiles. We would like to hear your voice at any time. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or needs. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSRKRNQOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonive","source_asin":"B093SMP7CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093SMP7CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093SMP7CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
