window.products.push({"id":573532,"name":"LIGICKY Japanese Style Doorway Curtain Noren Cotton Linen Retro Flowers Printed Window Treatment Hanging Door Tapestry for Home Decoration 33.5\" Width","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811sjjHjvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR STORY LIGICKY is a leading registered brand in the home decor industry. We have been looking for a new expression of art and life, in order to transfer their abstract beauty into concrete existence. It is our long-term pursuit to help customers have an artistic house. A warm home is our bay and solid base. LIGICKY Japanese Style Doorway Curtain Noren Cotton Linen Retro Flowers Printed Window Treatment Hanging Door Tapestry for Home Decoration 33.5\" Width x 47.2\" Long, Colourful Brand: LIGICKY Theme: Japanese Retro Flowers  Material: Cotton Linen Size: 33.5 x 47.2 inch (85 x 120 cm) Washing Notices: Hand or machine wash in cold water Iron in low temperature Package includes: 1 x Japanese Noren Door Curtain How to Use Simply place a rod through the upper part of the noren and hang from any doorway. Tension rod not included, you can also hang it by using push pin or thread. About the Noren This curtain is called noren in Japanese. Norens are ideal to create good Feng Shui environments, being used in homes, businesses and restaurants. The Japanese have been using them for hundreds of years. - In private homes, Japanese norens are used to separate rooms and doorways. - In businesses,they are used with the intention of denoting the specialty of the shop. - At restaurants, Japanese norens serve to create a sense of privacy for the customers. - Besides having a practical function, Japanese norens are also meant to add an air of beauty to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811sjjHjvoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIGICKY","source_asin":"B0B2W8BM93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2W8BM93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2W8BM93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573533,"name":"Swan in the Lake, Vertical Italian Tapestry Wallhanging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":194.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UBJ62O8wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Capture elegance and sophistication in any room of your home with Italian-woven tapestry wall hangings.All of the wall tapestries sold by Charlotte Home Furnishings are jacquard woven in Europe. They are all reproductions of original tapestry art pieces or oil paintings now displayed in museums and in private collections throughout the world.Why Tapestries?They are beautiful and elegantAdd a luxurious feelThe natural texture of a tapestry gives a warmer and softer look to the roomTapestries are tougher and far more durable compared to paper printsProduct Features:Jacquard Woven in ItalyBacked with lining and tunnel for easy hangingMaterial: 80% Cotton 20% Viscose and Polyester blend.Size: Width 18\" and Height 30\"* Rods or Tassels are not includedWhy choose Charlotte Home Furnishings Inc.?We offer a wide range of quality European tapestries and home decorating accessories at affordable prices.Fast shipping serviceFriendly & prompt assistanceCustomer Service is our top priorityAll our tapestry products are hand finished to high standards.100% money back guarantee.Fabric Care:An annual gentle brushing (with a soft brush) is sufficient to maintain your tapestry.Dry clean the tapestry only if required.Do NOT hang in direct sunlight (like most works of art direct sunlight will fade the art overtime)Add a luxurious style and unique flair to your home by choosing our tapestries. Click 'Add to Cart' above to get yours now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UBJ62O8wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C Charlotte Home Furnishings Inc.","source_asin":"B0BCKVC88F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKVC88F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKVC88F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
