window.products.push({"id":573640,"name":"Drinking Glasses - Set of 8 Glass Cups, 4 Highball Glasses (17oz) 4 Rocks Glasses (13oz) Ribbed Glasses for Mixed Drinks, Water, Juice, beer, Wine, Ex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x0ADnKeJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT GLASSES WITH A TOUCH OF FLAIR - These Solar glasses have a sharp, classic shape combined with a modern, colorful twist. The solar glasses is perfect for casual or formal use, layers beautifully with a variety of dinnerware and table settings. DURABLE: Firm base and thin shape for an easy grip. The thin and lightweight design of our glass tumbler makes it easy to hold, perfect for drinking while mingling. The glass solar Drinking Glasses is smooth from the outside and ribbed from inside. DISHWASHER SAFE: Made from premium quality glass, BPA and lead free. practical glass cups that are completely dishwasher safe for quick and easy cleanup. The glasses won't fade or lose its luster even after hundreds of dishwasher cycles. Guaranteed to withstand the test of time! SET OF 8- Glassware set includes 4- 17oz highball glasses and 4- 13oz rock size drinking glasses. Uses for any cocktail, homemade beverages or a glass of whiskey. VERSATILE USE: Use our drink glasses to prepare and enjoy your favorite beverages. The cooler glasses are ideal for cocktails and smoothies, while the rocks glasses are definitely the right choice for whiskey, gin, or brandy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x0ADnKeJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glaver's","source_asin":"B0891VSJBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0891VSJBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0891VSJBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573641,"name":"Now Designs Basic Apron, Tapenade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kcoJdSWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 45-year Now Designs has created kitchen textiles, table linens, and accessories that are consistently recognized for superior colors, trends, design, and unsurpassed quality and workmanship. This unisex Basic Apron is a beloved classic by Now Designs, and is truly a workhorse in the kitchen. It is made from heavy-weight 100-percent cotton and woven on an oversized loom making it 6-inch wider than other aprons to help provide the perfect fit. This apron is designed to fit men and women: it ties at the waist and features an adjustable neck strap for comfort. Stress points have been bar-tacked for extra durability, and the deep front pocket is great for tucking away recipe cards, tea towels, trivets and utensils. This attention to detail ensures that a Now Designs Basic Apron is sure to be a consistent kitchen companion for years to come. Care: Machine wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kcoJdSWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B009CUZTLE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009CUZTLE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009CUZTLE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
