window.products.push({"id":573764,"name":"Joseph Joseph MIMO012AS Mini Mosaic Worktop Saver, 12 x 16 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZPMnITG8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This worktop saver not only saves your worktop counter and tabletops, it also provides a hygienic, odor and stain resistant work surface for all of your food preparation tasks. Unfortunately, counter and tabletops often house harmful germs and bacteria. When food comes into contact with these contaminates, food becomes tainted and tainted food can make us very ill. Plus, using knives on stone, wood or laminate countertops, is never a good idea. Joseph Joseph's Worktop Savers save your worktops and save you. Plus, this worktop saver is made of toughened glass; it does not retain odors and stains and it will not break. Joseph Joseph is so sure of this that they offer a lifetime warrantee against breakage. They are that sure. The unique deigns is a Joseph Joseph original; not only will the Worktop Saver's functionality impress you, so too will the signature design. Mini Mosaic design. Saver measures 12 by 16 by 1/4-inch. Made in the UK.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZPMnITG8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joseph Joseph","source_asin":"B001H93BEK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001H93BEK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001H93BEK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":573765,"name":"SOLEDI Double Laundry Hamper with Lid and Removable Laundry Bags - 145L Large Hamper for Laundry - Laundry Basket 2 Sections - Collapsible Laundry Bas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZVFKMXUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oxford thicker fabric ✅ Sturdy and Durable: SOLEDI laundry hamper is made of high-density 601D oxford thickened fabric and 1.2mm waterproof membrane. The MDF panel is added at the bottom, a metal frame is embedded in the top to ensure structural stability of the hamper. The thickened 8 fiber rods keep the laundry basket upright and won't be deformed by too many clothes ✅Top Lid & Dual Handles: There are two sturdy handles on the left and right sides of the laundry basket with lid, making the laundry basket easy to carry. With a load weight of up to 42 lbs, it is durable. Flip-top lid keeps your dirty laundry hidden and keeps your bedroom, kid's room or nursery looking tidy ✅145L Large Capacity: The overall size of the entire basket is 22.5\" x 15\" x 26.5\", with a capacity of 145 liters, which can hold a family's laundry for a week (about 40-50 pieces of laundry). With 2 large divided sections, you can easily separate darks and lights, clothing from linens, his and her items, or child and adult pieces ✅ Easy to Carry: Each laundry hamper with lid comes with 2 removable liner bags, which can be easily removed from the liner bags attached to the basket and brought to the washing machine. The liner bag is made with high-quality stitching and can also be used as a clothes organizer ✅Easy to Install: Simply put the support rod into the fixed insertion tubes, tie 8 olive buckles into corresponding suspension loops, and it's ready to use. Set up in minutes, and also folds flat for convenient storage when not in use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZVFKMXUeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLEDI","source_asin":"B0C4PSB1FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4PSB1FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4PSB1FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
