window.products.push({"id":573812,"name":"Painless Learning Numbers with Animals Placemat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aiOtWWvWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Original Sky Diver From Prime Time Toys Recreates The Excitement Of A High Flying Parachute Jump. The One And Only Directional Parachute Flyer Comes With A Skydiver And A Parachute With Straps That Adjust And Control The Direction Of The Skydiver's Fall. The Parachute Is Made Of The Same Material Real Parajumpers Use, And It's Designed Not To Tangle No Matter What. Just A Flick Of Your Wrist Sends The Skydiver Flying. For Ages 5 And Over. Since 1990, Prime Time Toys, Ltd. Has Produced Fun, Innovative Toys And Games Your Family Can Enjoy Both Indoors And Out. Prime Time Toys Has Won Multiple Industry Awards For Creating New And Innovative Imaginative Toys For Outdoor And Pool Play.; From The Manufacturer; The Prime Time Toys Jump Zone Exists In That Creative Space In Your Backyard Or Playfield Where Visions Of The Sky Are Born. The Big Jump Launcher Recreates The Physics Of The Jump Zone With A Skydiver And An Easy Powerful Way To Launch Your Flyer High. Just Flick Your Wrist In A Chop/Throw Motion And Send Your Man Flying. Control The Direction Of Descent By Adjusting The Ends Of Parachute Attachments In The Skydivers Hands. Clever And Simple The Chute Never Tangles Made With Real Parachute Material And Includes Launcher. Prime Time Toys Has Won Multiple Industry Awards For Creating New And Innovative Imaginative Toys For Outdoor And Pool Play. Since 1990, Prime Time Toys, Ltd. Has Been Producing Fun, Innovative Toys And Games That Can Be Enjoyed Both In And Out Of The Water. Starting With The World Famous Splash Bombs, It Has Developed And Expanded Its Line Of Water Activities Designed To Give Families Hours Of Fun Together. Just Because Mom Is Sitting By The Pool Reading A Book Doesn't Mean She Doesn't Deserve A Good Soaking. Prime Time's Line Of Soft, Safe And Action Toys Ensure Endless Enjoyment, Indoors And Out. Prime Time Toys Is Proud To Say It Has Made A Big Splash Over The Past 20 Years, In Every Sense Of The Word.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aiOtWWvWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Painless Learning","source_asin":"B00IM75HUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IM75HUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IM75HUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
