window.products.push({"id":573875,"name":"Laboratory 29 Bamboo Bedside Shelf Storage Organizer Bedside Table for Bedroom Dorm Side Bunk Bed Shelf Caddy Small Spaces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711rP0CfdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT SPACE-SAVING SOLUTION: This dorm bed shelf is an ideal solution for smaller bedrooms, apartments, bunk beds, kids rooms, college dorms and lofts. The large size of the trays surface (11.8\" x 13.8\") is perfect for storing books, smartphones, tablets, watches, laptops, drinks, alarm clocks and anything else you might want to keep near your bed. Keep everything organized. GREAT SPACE-SAVING SOLUTION: This dorm bed shelf is an ideal solution for smaller bedrooms, apartments, bunk beds, kids rooms, college dorms and lofts. The large size of the trays surface (11.8\" x 13.8\") is perfect for storing books, smartphones, tablets, watches, laptops, drinks, alarm clocks and anything else you might want to keep near your bed. Keep everything organized. TOOL-FREE INSTALLATION: The bedside caddy easily attaches to bed frames up to 3 inches thick and adjusts for the perfect fight by using two simple clamps. No tools needed, simply place the bedside organizer on a bed frame and tighten the knobs on the two clamps to fit. PRACTICAL: The bunk bed tray organizer comes with a built-in cup holder, a watch charging stand, 3 slots that can hold multiple devices, and 2 slots for charging cables. This dorm bed table is the best for the bedroom and for your devices. The side bed table allows you to easily access your belongings while chilling out in your bed. Its an instant work space, bookshelf, food tray and nightstand all in one. DURABLE & HIGH QUALITY: The bed shelf is crafted from eco-friendly bamboo. A dual, heavy duty clamping system with thick felt padding on all touch points prevents the item from scratching your bedframe. The wooden dividers and watch stand of the nightstand tray serve as charging stations for your devices. WARRANTY: Our floating loft bed side table includes a 12-month manufacturer 100% money back guarantee. You are welcome to contact us if you have any questions or concerns. Our reliable US based customer service will be sure to reply within 24 hours and offer proper solutions for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711rP0CfdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laboratory 29","source_asin":"B07X75HF8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-573875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X75HF8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X75HF8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
